like now that these stats are out,

00:09:14.500 --> 00:09:16.500
it's bound to impact reality.

00:09:16.500 --> 00:09:20.180
And people will maybe try to game it

00:09:20.180 --> 00:09:22.340
and try to aim for this kind of day range,

00:09:22.340 --> 00:09:23.700
which is like maybe a good thing,

00:09:25.060 --> 00:09:25.540
but also-

00:09:25.540 --> 00:09:27.620
Well, let me talk about that as well then.

00:09:27.620 --> 00:09:28.420
Yeah, they would.

00:09:28.420 --> 00:09:30.500
And I waited a year to release these metrics.

00:09:30.500 --> 00:09:31.860
I said, here's some interesting stats.

00:09:31.860 --> 00:09:33.300
And I talked to our CEO about it.

00:09:34.260 --> 00:09:36.500
And yeah, they could try and game them.

00:09:36.500 --> 00:09:37.780
But here's how I-

00:09:37.780 --> 00:09:39.620
Let's talk about transparency side of this.

00:09:40.800 --> 00:09:42.080
When I lead teams,

00:09:42.720 --> 00:09:44.720
this meeting I talked about is a weekly meeting

00:09:44.720 --> 00:09:47.600
with the lead stakes between even going over-

00:09:47.600 --> 00:09:50.960
There might be 30 projects across a large team

00:09:50.960 --> 00:09:53.280
in progress at once, or maybe even more.

00:09:53.280 --> 00:09:54.640
I've had like 50 or 60.

00:09:55.280 --> 00:09:57.600
I can get through them all in a 30-minute meeting.

00:09:58.710 --> 00:09:59.830
Talking to folks that are on time,

00:09:59.830 --> 00:10:01.030
looking where risk is.

00:10:01.030 --> 00:10:02.070
But what happens is-

00:10:02.070 --> 00:10:03.510
But what happens is,

00:10:03.510 --> 00:10:04.950
is transparency.

00:10:04.950 --> 00:10:06.310
All the leads are there.

00:10:06.310 --> 00:10:08.470
They know enough about how things interact.

00:10:09.110 --> 00:10:11.590
They can tell if someone's padding and trying to game.

00:10:11.590 --> 00:10:14.870
So let's say John says,

00:10:14.870 --> 00:10:16.070
okay, we have this new project.

00:10:16.070 --> 00:10:16.710
It's coming in.

00:10:16.710 --> 00:10:18.870
It's going to be about four weeks to get done.

00:10:20.070 --> 00:10:22.150
Here's the impact it's going to have, blah, blah, blah.

00:10:22.710 --> 00:10:24.950
And then because it's transparent

00:10:24.950 --> 00:10:26.310
and we have psychological safety

00:10:26.310 --> 00:10:27.670
and people can speak up,

00:10:27.670 --> 00:10:31.330
when Jane chimes in and says,

00:10:32.130 --> 00:10:33.730
I did something very similar to this

00:10:34.290 --> 00:10:37.410
