I want teams to challenge each other.

00:11:07.170 --> 00:11:09.490
I want teams to hold each other accountable.

00:11:09.490 --> 00:11:11.090
It's not being accountable to me.

00:11:11.090 --> 00:11:12.930
It's about being accountable to yourself

00:11:12.930 --> 00:11:14.530
and being accountable to your teammates.

00:11:14.530 --> 00:11:15.730
I'm just a facilitator.

00:11:16.390 --> 00:11:18.390
