This is not German winter.

00:12:46.160 --> 00:12:48.800
It rains a lot here in Seattle, but we don't get snow.

00:12:48.800 --> 00:12:51.920
I played outside for a couple hours on Wednesday.

00:12:51.920 --> 00:12:52.560
It was great.

00:12:53.570 --> 00:12:55.650
So we can play outside as long as it's dry,

00:12:55.650 --> 00:12:56.850
the court's dry.

00:12:56.850 --> 00:12:58.210
There is a place near my house

00:12:58.210 --> 00:12:59.970
that has pickleball inside.

00:13:00.690 --> 00:13:02.850
Here's the interesting thing about Seattleites.

00:13:02.850 --> 00:13:04.450
And again, in my mini retirement,

00:13:04.450 --> 00:13:06.850
I'm playing pickleball three, four, five times a week.

00:13:06.850 --> 00:13:11.120
And Seattle, if it's not raining,

00:13:11.120 --> 00:13:12.560
people will want to be outside

00:13:12.560 --> 00:13:14.160
because we miss daylight.

00:13:14.160 --> 00:13:18.560
We have gray days and we have dark gray days.

00:13:18.560 --> 00:13:20.640
And it doesn't snow much, but it's cold.

00:13:20.640 --> 00:13:22.800
So anyway, Wednesday, it's funny.

00:13:22.800 --> 00:13:24.320
They had indoor pickleball on Wednesday,

00:13:24.320 --> 00:13:26.400
but nobody went inside because it was,

00:13:26.400 --> 00:13:28.000
the sun was out a little bit

00:13:28.000 --> 00:13:28.960
and the courts were dry.

00:13:28.960 --> 00:13:30.000
So we all played outside.

00:13:31.280 --> 00:13:34.160
There must have been 15, I can count here,

00:13:34.160 --> 00:13:36.480
four, six, eight, 12, probably eight waiting.

00:13:36.480 --> 00:13:38.400
So yeah, about 20 people on the court

00:13:40.050 --> 00:13:44.290
on a weekday at 10 to noon when I was there

00:13:44.290 --> 00:13:46.210
hanging out, playing pickleball, it was fun.

00:13:46.880 --> 00:13:48.880
But yeah, but you can do inside

00:13:48.880 --> 00:13:49.680
when there's gross weather,

00:13:49.680 --> 00:13:51.040
but just two days a week where I live.

00:13:51.040 --> 00:13:52.880
And if I wanted to drive somewhere

00:13:52.880 --> 00:13:54.240
and I never drive anywhere,

00:13:54.240 --> 00:13:55.360
if I wanted to drive somewhere,

00:13:55.360 --> 00:13:57.600
I could probably find more pickleball to play.

00:13:57.600 --> 00:14:00.800
But it's easy just to walk by.

00:14:00.800 --> 00:14:02.320
I kind of walk by on my way back

00:14:02.320 --> 00:14:03.120
from the grocery store.

00:14:07.590 --> 00:14:11.670
So anyway, so that's the recap of that.

00:14:11.670 --> 00:14:15.040
But looping the story back around

00:14:15.040 --> 00:14:16.320
