00:18:11.890 --> 00:18:17.440
but as you don't know me in person, I'm quiet.

00:18:17.440 --> 00:18:18.800
You know, I'm observant.

00:18:18.800 --> 00:18:19.840
I pay attention to things.

00:18:19.840 --> 00:18:20.720
I find patterns.

00:18:21.360 --> 00:18:22.400
