00:18:22.400 --> 00:18:24.320
but also I was keeping this trail journal

00:18:24.320 --> 00:18:25.680
and I was talking into my phone.

00:18:25.680 --> 00:18:27.520
And one day Spout came running up behind me

00:18:27.520 --> 00:18:29.680
