00:18:33.280 --> 00:18:35.490
I said, maybe.

00:18:35.490 --> 00:18:36.770
She goes, well, what's your trail name?

00:18:36.770 --> 00:18:37.270
Spy.

00:18:37.890 --> 00:18:42.130
So I became a spy and it stuck.

00:18:42.130 --> 00:18:43.890
And I liked it because I could,

00:18:46.100 --> 00:18:47.940
if I came out of the woods somewhere,

00:18:47.940 --> 00:18:49.780
or whether I'm getting lost

00:18:49.780 --> 00:18:52.180
or off doing trail duties or whatever,

00:18:52.180 --> 00:18:53.700
people go, oh my God, where'd you come from?

00:18:53.700 --> 00:18:55.460
I said, I was doing spy stuff.

00:18:56.370 --> 00:18:57.170
Cannot tell you.

00:18:57.170 --> 00:18:57.670
Yeah.

00:18:58.080 --> 00:18:59.360
So spy kind of stuck.

00:18:59.360 --> 00:19:01.360
And I even have, I don't have it here.

00:19:01.360 --> 00:19:04.230
I have, I even got a new hoodie

00:19:04.230 --> 00:19:05.670
that says spy on the back.

00:19:05.670 --> 00:19:06.470
I don't have it here,

00:19:06.470 --> 00:19:08.500
but lots of spy stuff.

00:19:08.500 --> 00:19:09.860
That's great for podcasting.

00:19:10.840 --> 00:19:11.160
Yeah.

00:19:11.160 --> 00:19:15.800
Spy has become a persona and I like being spy.

00:19:16.520 --> 00:19:18.040
When I hear my government name used,

00:19:18.040 --> 00:19:19.560
it just sounds weird still,

00:19:19.560 --> 00:19:21.080
even after being back from the trail

00:19:21.080 --> 00:19:25.040
for a month, a month and a half,

00:19:25.040 --> 00:19:27.040
two months and a half, something like that.

00:19:28.470 --> 00:19:29.990
Anyway, yeah, somewhere back there.

00:19:29.990 --> 00:19:33.110
There Cal, I mentioned gross.

