00:19:53.460 --> 00:19:56.340
Averaging 21, just over 21 miles a day,

00:19:56.980 --> 00:19:58.980
median 22.3, max day,

00:19:58.980 --> 00:20:00.820
my biggest day on trail, 33 miles.

00:20:01.860 --> 00:20:04.900
I was hiking and that 33 mile day was,

00:20:05.620 --> 00:20:07.460
we should get to this water source

00:20:07.460 --> 00:20:09.540
and camp there and get to the water source.

00:20:09.540 --> 00:20:12.840
There's already 12 tents there.

00:20:12.840 --> 00:20:17.400
We wedge in next to this poor hiker

00:20:17.400 --> 00:20:19.160
in a hammock who was going southbound

00:20:19.160 --> 00:20:22.280
and we just got these slanted spots

00:20:22.280 --> 00:20:24.920
next to him, crashed there,

00:20:25.940 --> 00:20:27.540
woke up the next morning, decided,

00:20:27.540 --> 00:20:29.540
eh, we can make it to the next water source.

00:20:29.540 --> 00:20:30.580
Didn't even go get the water

00:20:30.580 --> 00:20:31.860
because it's like a half mile off trail.

00:20:31.860 --> 00:20:34.180
So that was why I did 33 miles that day.

00:20:35.140 --> 00:20:38.660
But Oregon's also the day where I messed up my ankle

00:20:38.660 --> 00:20:40.500
