00:20:42.340 --> 00:20:44.100
because I hiked with a smashed ankle

00:20:44.100 --> 00:20:48.340
and still averaged over 21

00:20:48.340 --> 00:20:50.340
is pretty good miles there.

00:20:50.900 --> 00:20:51.700
You're going to say something.

00:20:54.240 --> 00:20:59.040
I was just, yeah, feeling with you.

