00:21:04.720 --> 00:21:06.800
And then Washington hauled,

00:21:06.800 --> 00:21:08.400
but again, 20 miles a day,

00:21:08.400 --> 00:21:10.480
a little slower Washington's a lot of up and down.

00:21:11.280 --> 00:21:12.400
Hiked a couple of days.

00:21:12.400 --> 00:21:13.120
My son came out.

00:21:13.120 --> 00:21:14.400
We affectionately called him Spy Kid

