00:21:33.880 --> 00:21:35.560
that move on because I track this stuff.

00:21:35.560 --> 00:21:37.080
I look for look at patterns,

00:21:37.080 --> 00:21:38.680
look for insights, track the system.

00:21:38.680 --> 00:21:40.040
Oregon, of course, the fastest,

