He's a data scientist.

00:26:07.490 --> 00:26:08.690
He can find some cool insights,

00:26:08.690 --> 00:26:10.690
but mostly I just walked and it was fun.

00:26:12.370 --> 00:26:15.890
So that I'm going to segue again here.

